    <string name="arena_waiting_tip_doubles">Roll doubles and your next consecutive roll gains a +1 bonus — chain them to break armor and land the blow.</string>
    <string name="arena_waiting_tip_rogue">The Rogue's Dodge stacks: every armor an opponent fails to break hardens it further, up to +2 for the match.</string>
    <string name="arena_waiting_tip_mage">The Mage's Spell Potency turns doubles into a storm — full damage to your target, half to everyone else.</string>
    <string name="arena_waiting_tip_duelist">The Duelist's Riposte can spin an attack right back at the attacker. Pass their armor at your peril.</string>
    <string name="arena_waiting_tip_gambler">All-In is a gamble: a 1 knocks you out, but a 5 or 6 lets the Gambler strike twice this round.</string>
    <string name="arena_waiting_tip_paladin">A Paladin can cheat death once a match — Holy Shield may leave them standing on 1 Health, then lash back.</string>

